/-!
# Generated same-compiler relation-lineage recurrence stage

One minimal stage stores only the data that definitionally generated its
append root. Visit zero is that root's unique selection answer; retained visit
one folds the current lineage into the next action carrier. The generated
actual-action target is the next stage. `Nat` indexes this repeated write; it
never selects an event, carrier, branch or future table.
-/

